        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ethylvinylacetate, foil, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ethylvinylacetate, foil, at plant
Example process for the utilization of the different converting modules in the database.;
UUID: 1ef6ea99-4478-3315-b947-9ba1e37bd1e8
This process contains the plastic amount and the transport of the plastic from the production site to the converting site as well as the dataset "extrusion, plastic film
Location: based on average European extrusion process
Technology: present technologies
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: na
Sampling: company data 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1ef6ea99-4478-3315-b947-9ba1e37bd1e8.xml</text>
